@host = http://localhost:5180
@wallet = replace-with-the-id-returned-by-open

### Open a wallet; copy walletId from the 201 response into @wallet
POST {{host}}/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Primary rewards" }

### Read wallet details
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}

### Earn points
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "points": 100, "reason": "Purchase reward" }

### Redeem points
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222", "points": 40, "reason": "Gift redemption" }

### Check the balance (60 after the preceding requests)
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/balance

### Check affordability without changing the balance
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/can-afford?requiredPoints=60

### Read the immutable transaction ledger
GET {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20

### Rejected overdraft (422; balance stays 60)
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operationId": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333", "points": 61, "reason": "Overspend example" }

### Suspend redemptions; credits remain accepted
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/suspend

### Reactivate redemptions
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/reactivate

### Permanently close the wallet
POST {{host}}/api/wallets/{{wallet}}/close
